34
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:28,170
Third Elder of the Giant Demon Clan
Peak Late stage Soul Formation

35
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,170
Whether it's Ceng Niu or Ceng Ma,

36
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,170
Note: "Niu" mean "cow" and "Ma" means "horse"

37
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,120
