41
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,320
Although the Ancestor was wrong,

42
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:43,920
he is the hope of the Giant Demon Clan.

43
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:45,920
But Ceng Niu…

44
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:48,720
