47
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,770
Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor,

48
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,000
come out now !

49
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:22,040
Who are you !?

50
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,280
Ceng Niu.

51
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:27,440
Ceng Niu, he's the one who won against Red Butterfly !

52
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:29,410
The number one cultivator under Soul Transformation !

53
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,000
Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,

54
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:34,640
why are you looking for the Ancestor ?

55
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:36,160
To kill him.

56
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,920
The Giant Demon Clan is linked by blood,

57
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,840
we’re not like Xue Yue !

58
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:46,240
Since you disrespect the Ancestor,

59
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:49,200
don’t blame us for being ruthless !

60
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,520
I use my status as the Elder of the Giant Demon Clan

61
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,680
to order all clan members

62
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,760
to use everything they have

63
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,480
to kill Ceng Niu !

64
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,050
Kill him !

65
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,250
Kill him !

66
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,370
Kill him !

67
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,730
Seal !

68
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,320
Scram !

69
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,130
Brother Ceng,

70
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,320
please spare them !

71
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:27,960
Chi Hu…

72
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:35,880
Brother Ceng…

73
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:38,200
Do you consider me, Chi Hu, your friend ?

74
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,320
I don't have many friends in my life,

75
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:42,240
but you, Chi Hu, are one.

76
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,890
The Giant Demon Clan wronged you first

77
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:47,320
so Brother Ceng’s actions are justified.

78
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,720
But I…

79
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,320
am the Giant Demon Clan’s successor.

80
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:54,200
If Brother Ceng really sees me as a friend

81
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:56,320
then I beg you to show mercy

82
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,920
and to leave the clan.

83
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,840
Do you know why I haven't killed anyone yet ?

84
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,640
Chi Hu…

85
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,360
If it weren't for you,

86
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,330
