98
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:42,760
Brother Ceng,

99
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,560
the Giant Demon Clan isn’t your enemy.

100
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,520
Where is the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor ?

101
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,360
I might spare him

102
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,000
