104
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,920
No one knows where the Ancestor is hidden.

105
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,320
Only by activating the Heaven Reaching Formation

106
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,920
can we contact him.

107
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:00,960
Brother Ceng,

108
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,720
if he returns your sword

109
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,680
will you really leave ?

110
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,120
Three Elders,

111
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,240
