112
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,800
I order you to open the Heaven Reaching Formation !

113
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:22,520
Giant Demon Clan's Heaven Reaching Formation !

114
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:25,080
Southern Giant Demon Gate

115
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,080
Western Giant Demon Gate

116
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,080
Northern Giant Demon Gate

117
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,200
Activate !

118
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:40,080
Ceng Niu always exacts his vengeance.

119
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,760
Since the Ancestor wronged him,

120
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:45,160
he won’t spare the Ancestor’s life.

121
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:47,840
He asked for the sword

122
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,720
