125
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,680
Brother Ceng,

126
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,720
I'm sorry for betraying you.

127
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:16,400
But the Ancestor is our clan’s hope

128
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,840
As the successor,

129
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,000
