138
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,560
I owe you

139
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,970
for your help in Xue Yue.

140
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,000
From now on,

141
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,640
