142
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,080
Even...

143
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,730
that's correct...

144
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,760
The two of us

145
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,920
are even !

146
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,010
Chi Hu,

147
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:57,200
do you really think this Heaven Reaching Formation

148
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,680
can kill me ?

149
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,370
That's the first blow.

150
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,520
Can an outsider really withstand

151
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,000
the formation with his body ?!

152
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,960
Second blow !

153
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:15,640
What ?!

154
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,680
How can he...

155
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:17,720
Impossible !

156
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,810
This is impossible !

157
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,160
Even the Ancestor

158
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:37,160
could only endure 8 blows.

159
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:40,120
He can’t possibly survive the 12th !

160
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:42,520
This is the final blow.

161
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,120
Chi Hu,

162
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,960
watch closely !

163
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,760
Giant Demon Clan's Heaven Reaching Formation,

164
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,800
fall !

165
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,800
Fall !

166
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,920
So this is your true strength…

167
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,890
It looks like

168
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:34,960
even Master underestimated you.

169
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,080
Since none of you will speak,

170
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:41,520
then I will use your formation to send my voice

171
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:44,570
far enough so your Ancestor will hear it.

172
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:46,360
Giant Demon Clan Ancestor,

173
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,400
come for your death !

174
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,920
Giant Demon Clan Ancestor,

175
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,240
come for your death !

176
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:56,120
The fiend !

177
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,600
You really used the vibration of the formation collapse

178
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:02,720
to send your threat to me ?!

179
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:04,720
How arrogant !

180
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:08,320
Once I have finished my possession,

181
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:10,160
I'll come to kill you immediately !

182
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:12,400
12 blows...

183
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:14,720
This is unheard of

184
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:17,120
in the clan's history.

185
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,770
Giant Demon Clan,

186
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:19,560
seal !

187
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,560
From now on,

188
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:25,770
there will be no Nascent Soul or above cultivators !

189
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,080
Without my approval,

190
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:31,040
you will not get past Core Formation.

191
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:35,280
This is your punishment.

192
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,120
Master,

193
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,320
let me out !

194
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:40,520
I’ll fight him to the death !

195
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:45,120
What did Wang Lin ever do to you

196
00:10:44,960 --> 00:10:47,120
to make you hate him so much ?

197
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,960
He treated me worse than dirt !

198
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,520
He's nothing like you, Master !

199
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:54,240
Once we kill Wang Lin,

200
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:55,800
will you let me

201
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:59,720
see that little sister in your artifact.

202
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,920
Not yet,

203
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:03,160
once I fully recover,

204
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:06,200
I’ll let you meet her.

205
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,600
Come out !

206
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:33,090
You overestimate yourself.

207
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:35,640
I planned to let you live a few more days

208
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:38,120
but since you’re eager to die,

209
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,160
I'll deal with you right now !

210
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:52,930
His possession isn't complete

211
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:55,130
yet he’s already this powerful ?

212
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:57,680
If he fully recovers,

213
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:01,120
his body might rival the strength

214
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:04,330
a 3-star Ancient God !

215
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:09,160
How can his body be stronger than mine ?!

216
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:15,160
I wanted to avoid

217
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:18,130
using celestial spiritual energy during the possession.

218
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,720
But it looks like

219
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,920
I have no choice !

220
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:38,320
Slash him to death !

221
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:40,200
Got it !

222
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,360
Wang Lin,

223
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:43,840
your Grandpa Xu has come !

224
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:47,920
Watch as I kill you with your own sword !

225
00:12:57,480 --> 00:13:00,720
I, Xu Liguo, have always been loyal.

226
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,400
Did you think you could control me so easily ?

227
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,520
How did you do it ?!

228
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:07,960
I had planted a restriction on you !

229
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,600
That's funny because,

230
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:12,560
you’re no match for my master in restrictions.

231
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,120
Xu Liguo...

232
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:25,960
Master,

233
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,520
I have done well this time,

234
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:29,600
be sure to reward me !

235
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:33,520
The fiend is still the fiend...

236
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:34,720
Alright.

237
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,280
Really !?

238
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:41,930
Mountains East of the
Giant Demon Clan

239
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:41,920
Bastard,

240
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,440
where are you running to ?!

241
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:46,280
Blackflame Beast,

242
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,320
appear !

243
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:15,370
Since he has a Soul Transformation cultivation,

244
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,320
I don't think he played all his cards yet.

245
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:25,520
I, the 67th-generation Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor,

246
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:27,280
offer my blood

247
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:29,800
to summon the ancestral artifact !

248
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:48,880
Our Ancestor once split heaven and earth with this axe.

249
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:52,600
He killed two 9-leaf Warriors of the Forsaken Immortal Clan !

250
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:55,200
Being killed by it

251
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:57,200
is an honor.

252
00:14:57,160 --> 00:15:00,640
Now go to hell !

253
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:08,120
I can't withstand this thing !

254
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,050
A perfect opportunity !

255
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,200
Lady Liu Mei,

256
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:27,000
your opponent

257
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,640
is me.

258
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:33,360
So what if you're a candidate of Uncle Yunque ?

259
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:36,880
With your mere Middle stage Soul Formation cultivation,

260
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,690
you can't stop me.

261
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,560
In that case,

262
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,480
please enlighten me.

263
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,680
Come out !

264
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,720
Weren't you going to kill me !?

265
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:08,120
Sub Soul Flag,

266
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,160
come !

267
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,000
This...

268
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:25,440
