269
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,160
The Billion-Soul Flag ?

270
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,770
Du Tian actually gave it to Wang Lin !?

271
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,760
Lady Liu Mei,

272
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,720
