273
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,800
for this Soul Flag.

274
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:24,610
Devour !

275
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:42,440
The body I was painstakingly taking possession of was destroyed

276
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:45,170
and my Origin Soul was severely injured again...

277
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,800
Wang Lin...

278
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:51,040
Bloodline power !

279
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:57,520
Even if my Origin Soul collapses, I'll drag you down with me !

280
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,800
I'll teleport you in the void

281
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,120
with no way back

282
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,640
and nowhere to go.

283
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,400
You will live in constant fear

284
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:08,000
until you die miserably !

285
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,370
Formation, activate !

286
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,800
This jade slip

287
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:17,400
details how to counter the Giant Demon Clan's teleportation spell.

288
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,160
How ?!

289
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:25,200
I can't stop your bloodline power,

290
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:28,240
but if I can find my way back,

291
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,800
then it's useless.

292
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,520
An Orientation Formation...

293
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,600
You...

294
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:35,040
are already dead.

295
00:18:44,320 --> 00:18:45,640
This is impossible...

296
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:51,840
This is impossible !!!

297
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:01,440
Zhuque Zi will likely soon learn

298
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:04,120
of the deaths of the Giant Demon Clan's Ancestor and Li Yuanfeng.

299
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:07,640
But there are more pressing matters now.

300
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:10,330
It's nearly been

301
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:12,040
18 years.

302
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:16,170
Law of the heavens...

303
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:17,160
Once again,

304
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:21,840
I will take Wan'er back from you !

305
00:19:42,290 --> 00:19:45,840
To let go of the consequences of my actions

306
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:47,560
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

307
00:19:47,350 --> 00:19:49,500
like scattered ink.

308
00:19:50,130 --> 00:19:56,980
As destiny falls

309
00:19:52,970 --> 00:19:56,980
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

310
00:19:56,730 --> 00:20:04,580
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

311
00:19:59,970 --> 00:20:04,580
wither and melt into rivers.

312
00:20:04,770 --> 00:20:12,140
Who can deceive

313
00:20:07,530 --> 00:20:12,140
the law of the heavens ?

314
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:15,460
Countless generations

315
00:20:13,490 --> 00:20:15,460
have tried before me.

316
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:19,180
But how could I not catch my dreams

317
00:20:17,330 --> 00:20:19,180
within my warm fingers ?

318
00:20:19,490 --> 00:20:23,260
You're at my side when I'm alone

319
00:20:23,010 --> 00:20:26,580
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

320
00:20:27,090 --> 00:20:30,540
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

321
00:20:30,650 --> 00:20:34,740
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

322
00:20:32,490 --> 00:20:34,740
in the streets.

323
00:20:34,650 --> 00:20:39,700
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

324
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:39,700
Can I break the rules ?

325
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:42,420
To run towards you !

326
00:20:42,210 --> 00:20:45,740
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

327
00:20:45,490 --> 00:20:50,380
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

328
00:20:50,130 --> 00:20:53,780
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

329
00:20:53,570 --> 00:20:58,460
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

330
00:20:58,660 --> 00:21:04,140
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

331
00:21:04,010 --> 00:21:08,060
If your soul is willing to wander,

332
00:21:07,810 --> 00:21:12,700
can I still take your hands

333
00:21:09,490 --> 00:21:12,700
and hold them tight ?

334
00:21:12,610 --> 00:21:15,780
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

335
00:21:15,530 --> 00:21:20,660
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

336
00:21:20,420 --> 00:21:23,940
I dream of destroying

337
00:21:23,850 --> 00:21:28,660
the shackles of our fate.

338
00:21:28,410 --> 00:21:32,620
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

339
00:21:32,370 --> 00:21:35,420
You're the hardest to let go of.

340
00:21:35,250 --> 00:21:39,300
I want to be with you again

341
00:21:39,130 --> 00:21:42,660
so I can look in your eyes.

342
00:21:42,690 --> 00:21:47,900
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
